%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8457553d7570b1146a94bd661e6d7528, type: 3}
  m_Name: Mutant Exterminators Mission
  missionName: Mutant Exterminators
  description: The mutations have produced creatures and altered fighters that now threaten ordinary settlements. Eliminate {Objective0Target} hostile Mutant crisis actors and remove the immediate biological threat by force.
  flavorText: Whatever these beings might have become under different circumstances, the ones attacking our people have made coexistence an increasingly dangerous gamble. Soldiers will be ordered into contaminated districts, abandoned laboratories, and settlement outskirts to hunt the hostile altered wherever they gather. Their unfamiliar bodies may resist conditions that would cripple ordinary troops, but unfamiliar does not mean invincible. Every dangerous specimen destroyed reduces the chance that violence will spread beyond the regions already affected. Scientists and philosophers may argue later over whether every altered life deserved the same fate. The forces in the field have been given a narrower question: which creatures are trying to kill our people, and how quickly can they be stopped?
  splashImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d04d89256ba796e4ebf1d283615ee5fb, type: 3}
  victorySplashImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 34321075fbca25045904c24b891a7103, type: 3}
  failureSplashImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9e23f233cc2b645428be15672272259f, type: 3}
  victoryFlavorText: "Hostile altered forces were reduced below operational threat levels. Settlements at the edge of contaminated zones report fewer incursions, and military patrols have regained route control in previously abandoned sectors. The immediate danger has been blunted through decisive force. Security returns first, while the moral debate continues later."
  failureFlavorText: "Elimination goals were not reached, leaving enough hostile altered actors to sustain attacks. Field units faced attrition, difficult terrain, and adaptive opponents without achieving strategic suppression. Civilians remain exposed in contested corridors where the threat should have been cleared. The extermination campaign inflicted losses, but not resolution."
  participantRole: 0
  strategyTags: 129
  objectives:
  - objectiveName: Mutant Exterminators
    description: Eliminate {Objective0Target} hostile Mutant crisis actors.
    type: 21
    targetValue: 0
    targetMode: 9
    targetMultiplier: 0.6
    minimumTarget: 2
    maximumTarget: 12
    useCrisisActorTagFilter: 1
    targetCrisisActorTags: 512
  constraints: []
  rewardTiers:
  - tierName: Complete
    requiredObjectivesCompleted: 1
    rewardLegacy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 97c60aec84f24d1e91a76b8b7a1891a7, type: 2}
